quem incolae loci Windloch <NOTE N="274" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0469" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0469"></COL> Wildloch 2. 3. 4.</NOTE>  nominant <NOTE N="(135)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0470" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0470C"></COL> Wildeloh in advocatia Oldenburg, silva in
