Brusdago  <HI REND="ITALIC">Alb. Stad.</HI></NOTE> , Biberlacho <NOTE N="282" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0469" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0469"></COL> Biberlach 2. 3. 4.</NOTE> , iterumque
mare, firmos et intransibiles <NOTE N="283" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0469" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0469"></COL> intransgressibiles 2. 3. 4.</NOTE>  circumscribi
 <COL N="0470B"></COL> jussimus <NOTE N="284" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0469" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0469"></COL> jussiomus 1.</NOTE> . Et ut hujus donationis ac circumscriptionis
 <COL N="0471A"></COL> auctoritas nostris futurisque temporibus Domino
protegente valeat inconvulsa manere, manu
