mons unicus est Albere <NOTE N="1135" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Alber civitatis Liubice 6.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Legendum:</HI>  Alberc.  <HI REND="ITALIC">De
quo monte postea Segeberg nuncupato v. Helmold l. I.</HI>  Albere 2. 3. 4.</NOTE>  et <NOTE N="1136" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita correxi;</HI>  est 2. 3. 4.</NOTE>  civitas Liubice <NOTE N="1137" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Lubecke
2. Liubeke 4. Luibeke 5. Luitbeke  <HI REND="ITALIC">M. F. In cod. 3. hoc scholion ita legitur:</HI>  Travenna fluvius est,
