quem Sclavi Mescenreiza vocant, a quo sursum
limes currit per silvam Delvunder <NOTE N="1112" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Delunder 3. Deluundez  <HI REND="ITALIC">M. F.</HI></NOTE>  usque in fluvium
