4. Houehembici 3.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(341)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509C"></COL> Rivulus juxta Hornbeck in parochia Breitenfelde.</NOTE>  et Bilenispring <NOTE N="1115" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Hylemspring 2. Hilimpring 3. Heilmspring 4. Heilinspring 5. Heilingspring
