ad Liudwinestein <NOTE N="1116" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Luidwinestein 2. Ludwinestein 4. Ziudwinsten 3.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(343)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509C"></COL> Fortasse Steinhorst.</NOTE>  et Wispircon <NOTE N="1117" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Wifpircon 1. 6. Wisbircon 4.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(344)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509C"></COL> Wesenberg, villa parochialis prope Travennam.</NOTE> 
et Birznig <NOTE N="1118" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Hyrzing 2. 3. Hirzing 4. Husinc 5.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(345)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509C"></COL> Birneze s. Bisneze, hodie Bissenitz, rivulus
qui limitem constituit possessionum monasterii
