in Travennam mergitur.</NOTE>  vadit usque <NOTE N="1120" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> usque  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  in Travena <NOTE N="1121" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509"></COL> Travennam 2. 3. 4.</NOTE> 
