et Warnabi <NOTE N="1172" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0511" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0511"></COL> Warnahi 2. 3. 4.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(358)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0512" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0512C"></COL> Sic dicti a fluvio Warnow.</NOTE> . Mox habitant Chizzini <NOTE N="(359)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0512" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0512C"></COL> Quorum nomen asservatur in villa Kessin
