3.</NOTE> , civitas eorum vulgatissima Rethre <NOTE N="(367)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513C"></COL> Juxta villam Prillwitz prope Neu-Strelitz.</NOTE> ,
sedes ydolatriae <NOTE N="1192" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> idololatriae 5.</NOTE> . Templum ibi magnum constructum
est demonibus, quorum princeps est <NOTE N="1193" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> est  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  3. 4.</NOTE>  Redigas
