ad Jumne <NOTE N="1215" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita hic</HI>  1. 4. Jummem 2 Jumnoe 3. Julinum 5. Vimno
6.</NOTE>  civitatem per terram; nam <NOTE N="1216" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> si  <HI REND="ITALIC">addunt</HI>  2. 3. 4.</NOTE> 
