Chive <NOTE N="1222" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> Chiwe 6. Chyve 3. Chive 4. Clyve 2.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(375)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0514" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0514C"></COL> Kiew.</NOTE> , aemula sceptri Constantinopolitani,
clarissimum decus Graeciae. Sicut ergo praedictum
est, Oddara flumen oritur in profundissimo saltu <NOTE N="*" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  18. Marahi <NOTE N="1226" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> Marachi 2. 4.</NOTE>  sunt populi Sclavorum, qui sunt ab oriente Behemorum <NOTE N="1227" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> Boemorum 4.</NOTE> , habentque in circuitu
