Postinagos 2. 5.</NOTE> ,
qui humanis carnibus vescuntur. (2. 4. 6.)</NOTE> 
Marahorum <NOTE N="1223" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> Marachorum 2. Maracorum 3. Merahorum 4.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(376)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0514" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0514C"></COL> Mahren.</NOTE>  ubi et Albia noster <NOTE N="1224" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0513" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0513"></COL> nostre
3. fluvius 4.</NOTE>  principium
sortitur, nec longis ab invicem spatiis, sed
