et sepultus est in civitate sua Magadburc <NOTE N="1240" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> Magedburg 2.
Magdaburg 4. Magdeburg 3. 5.</NOTE> . Cui <NOTE N="1241" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> Cujus 3.</NOTE> 
filius <NOTE N="1242" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> ejus  <HI REND="ITALIC">addit</HI>  4.</NOTE>  Otto medianus succedens, per decem
annos strennue gubernavit imperium. Is statim
Lothario et Karolo, Francorum regibus <NOTE N="(377)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515C"></COL> Carolus, regis Lotharii frater, dux fuit
Lotharingorum.</NOTE> ,
subactis, cum in Calabriam bellum transferret <NOTE N="1243" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> transferet 1.</NOTE> ,
a Sarracenis <NOTE N="1244" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> Saracenis 3.  <HI REND="ITALIC">F.</HI></NOTE>  et Graecis victor et victus, apud
Romam decessit <NOTE N="1245" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> discessit 3. 5.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(378)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515C"></COL> Mirum Adamum hic tacere de bello Haraldi
regis contra Ottonem II anno 974, mox tamen
sopito. V. Thietmar. l. III, c. 4; Annales Altahenses;
Lambert.; W. Giesebrecht Otto II.</NOTE> . Illi <NOTE N="1246" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> Huic 4.</NOTE>  tercius Otto, cum
adhuc puer esset, in regnum substitutus, annos
 <COL N="0516A"></COL> 18 <NOTE N="1247" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> XXVIII. 2. 3. 4.</NOTE>  forti et justo sceptrum ornavit imperio. His
tribus, aeque fortissimis ac justissimis imperatoribus,
tam carus <NOTE N="1248" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> charus 5.</NOTE>  ac <NOTE N="1249" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> et 4.</NOTE>  familiaris erat sanctus <NOTE N="1250" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> praesul 4.</NOTE> 
Adaldagus pro virtutis <NOTE N="1251" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> virtutum
2. 3. 4.</NOTE>  merito et doctrinae magisterio,
ut a latere eorum vix aut raro divelleretur
