Hermannus <NOTE N="1253" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> Herimannus 4.</NOTE> , Saxonum dux, obiens <NOTE N="1254" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0515" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0515"></COL> obediens 1.</NOTE> 
