desunt</HI>  1.</NOTE> ].</P> <P COM="0518">24. [17.] In Aldinburg ordinavit archiepiscopus
primo, ut diximus <NOTE N="(398)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0518" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0518C"></COL> Vide supra cap. 14.</NOTE> , Egwardum <NOTE N="1300" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0517" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0517"></COL> Edwardum 4.</NOTE>  vel Evargum
 <NOTE N="1301" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0517" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0517"></COL> vel E.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  4.</NOTE> , deinde <NOTE N="1302" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0517" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0517"></COL> dein  <HI REND="ITALIC">M. F.</HI></NOTE>  Wegonem <NOTE N="1303" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0517" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0517"></COL> Wigonem. 1.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(399)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0518" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0518C"></COL> De Wegone conf. Helmoldum l. I, c.
13, 14.</NOTE> , postea
