Ann. Sax. a. 1032.</NOTE> , indictione XIII <NOTE N="1964" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> 13.  <HI REND="ITALIC">omnes codd. male.</HI>  Cujus obitus cont. a. D. MXXXII. ind. XIII. VIII. Kal. Sept. 4.</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0547">66.  <CITN>([50.] Cap. 102.)</CITN>  Hermannus <NOTE N="**" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  49. Hermannus <NOTE N="1986" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> Herimannus 4.</NOTE>  ab incolis terrae paludem Eternbroch <NOTE N="1987" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> Etermbroch 2. Eternibroch 4. Etinborch 5.
