meruit, palleum a papa juniore <NOTE N="1966" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> minore 3. 5.</NOTE>  Benedicto,
ab Halverstatensi choro electus, ejusdem ecclesiae
fuit praepositus <NOTE N="(532)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547C"></COL> Ann. Hildesh. a 1032, 1035.</NOTE> . Vir, ut aiunt, columbinae <NOTE N="1967" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> mire 4.</NOTE> 
simplicitatis, sed parum habens prudentiae serpentis
 <NOTE N="(533)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547C"></COL> Respexit noster Ev. Matth. c. X. v. 16.</NOTE> ; ideoque facile deceptus est <NOTE N="1968" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> est  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  3. 4.</NOTE>  a
