habuit capellanos, Thiadricum <NOTE N="1971" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> Tiadernum 1. Thiadericum 4. Theodericum 2.</NOTE>  et <NOTE N="***" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  50. Iste Suidger <NOTE N="1989" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> Sindiger 3.
