ex ordine tribus scismaticis. (2. 3. 4.)</NOTE>  Suidgerum <NOTE N="1972" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> Swidgerum
2. Sindgerum 3. 5.</NOTE> ,
quem deinde Romana sedes appellavit
