 <NOTE N="1980" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> Reinwardi 3. 4.</NOTE>  ab eo loco sustulit, ac recondidit eos <NOTE N="1981" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> eos  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4.</NOTE> 
in majori basilica sub ipso <NOTE N="1982" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> ipso  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  tribunali <NOTE N="****" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0547" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0547"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  51. Dicunt enim, si vitam haberet longiorem, velle omnia renovare. Unde et murum civitati
ambire cepit, et oratorium destruxit, aliaque multa, in quibus voluntas ejus potest videri
non mala. (2.)</NOTE> .
