dirimit, quod <NOTE N="3483" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> qui 1. 4. 6. qui fluvius 2. 9.</NOTE>  oritur in profundissimo saltu paganorum
