 <COL N="0620B"></COL> in Alaburg <NOTE N="3496" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> in A.  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2. 5. 9.</NOTE>  per directum <NOTE N="3497" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> directam
7. 9.</NOTE>  viam metiris <NOTE N="3498" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> metieris 7 <SUP>b</SUP> <SUP>c</SUP> . mearis 7 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> ,
quinque aut septem <NOTE N="3499" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> sex 7. 8. 9. 10.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Voci</HI>  quinque  <HI REND="ITALIC">in cod. 6. superscriptum est:</HI>  in Alaburch,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">voci septem:</HI>  in Wendila.</NOTE>  habes iter dierum <NOTE N="3500" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> aut sex dierum habens tunc in Wendilam 7.</NOTE> . Haec
est strata <NOTE N="3501" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> stacio 7. statura 6.</NOTE>  Ottonis caesaris usque ad mare novissimum
