Latitudo Judlant <NOTE N="3506" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0619" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0619"></COL> Jutlandie  <CITN>(Judlandie 9)</CITN>  sive Jucie 2. 9. Judlandiae sive Jutiae 8. 10.</NOTE>  secus Egdoram diffusior est,
