ab  <HI REND="ITALIC">insula</HI>  que . .  <HI REND="ITALIC">os</HI> tio . .  <HI REND="ITALIC">a litt</HI> ore . . sita . . olmo . . in me . .  <HI REND="ITALIC">v</HI> ela pan <HI REND="ITALIC">di</HI>  usque ad  <HI REND="ITALIC">Fa</HI> rriam
in  <HI REND="ITALIC">Da</HI> nia etiam . . . cimus. (6.)</NOTE> , primum repperisse,
constructoque ibi monasterio fecisse habitabilem <NOTE N="3584" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> archiepiscopo.
Fama est Farriam—oceano, tunc primum repertam esse (fuisse 7 <SUP>c</SUP> )—factam esse habitabilem 7.</NOTE> .
Haec insula contra Hadeloam <NOTE N="3585" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> Hadeleiam 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  sita est. Cujus latitudo
 <NOTE N="3586" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Lege:</HI>  longitudo.</NOTE>  vix octo miliaria panditur, latitudo quatuor,
homines stramine fragmentisque navium pro
 <COL N="0623B"></COL> igne utuntur. Sermo est, piratas, si quando praedam
 <NOTE N="3587" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> praedictam 7 <SUP>a</SUP> , praedicta 7 <SUP>c</SUP> . praedictam insulam 7 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  inde vel <NOTE N="3588" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> vel
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6. licet 7.</NOTE>  minimam tulerint <NOTE N="3589" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> abstulerint 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> , aut mox
perisse naufragio aut occisos ab aliquo, nullum domum
redisse indempnem. Quapropter solent heremitis
ibi viventibus decimas praedarum offerre cum
magna devotione <NOTE N="3590" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> Haec insula—devotione  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  2. 4. 8. 9. 10.</NOTE> . Est enim haec insula <NOTE N="3591" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> haec insula
 <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  2. 4. 5. 8. 9. 10.</NOTE>  feracissima
frugum, ditissima volucrum et pecudum
nutrix <NOTE N="3592" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> volucrum, pecudum multiplex (nutrix 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .) 7.</NOTE> , collem habet unicum, arborem nullam,
scopulis includitur asperrimis <NOTE N="3593" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> acerrimis 9. 10.</NOTE> , nullo aditu praeter
unum <NOTE N="3594" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> aditu
nisi uno 4. 5.</NOTE> , ubi et aqua <NOTE N="3595" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> aquae 7.</NOTE>  dulcis, locus venerabilis
omnibus nautis, praecipue veo pyratris. Unde <NOTE N="3596" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> et  <HI REND="ITALIC">addit</HI>  8 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  accepit
 <COL N="0623C"></COL> nomen, ut Heiligland <NOTE N="3597" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> Heilighland 2. Heiligeland 4. 5. 9. Heligland 7.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ubi in
margine</HI>  Heligeland, Heiliglanndt 10.</NOTE>  dicatur. <NOTE N="***" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol. 105. In vita</HI>  Liudgeri  <HI REND="ITALIC">narrat</HI> ur Karoli  <HI REND="ITALIC">tempore</HI>  quidam Lan <HI REND="ITALIC">dricus nom</HI> ine baptiza <HI REND="ITALIC">tus esse ab</HI> 
episcopo. (6.)</NOTE>  Hanc in
 <COL N="0624A"></COL> vita sancti Willebrordi Fosetisland <NOTE N="3598" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> Villebrordi Fostisland 9. Fotislandt 10.</NOTE>  appellari <NOTE N="3599" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> appellatam 7d.</NOTE> 
discimus <NOTE N="3600" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> dicimus
7. didicimus 4.</NOTE> , quae sita est in confinio Danorum et
Fresonum <NOTE N="(833)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623D"></COL> V. Vitam S. Willebrordi ab Alcuino scriptam
et Vitam S. Liudgeri l. I, cap. 19.</NOTE> . Sunt et aliae insulae contra Fresiam
 <NOTE N="3601" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> Frisiam 7.</NOTE>  et Daniam, sed nulla earum tam memorabilis.</P> <P COM="0624">4.  <CITN>(Cap. 211.)</CITN>  Funis insula est non modica, post
eam, quae Wendila <NOTE N="3602" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> Wendula 7.</NOTE>  dicitur, in ostio barbari sinus
occurrens. Haec adhaeret <NOTE N="(834)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623D"></COL> Voluit dicere noster:  <HI REND="ITALIC">valde propinqua, vicina
 <COL N="0624D"></COL> est,</HI>  seu  <HI REND="ITALIC">quasi adhaeret.</HI></NOTE>  regioni quae Judland
dicitur, <NOTE N="3603" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> in ostio—dicitur  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  7.</NOTE> , in quam <NOTE N="3604" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> qua 7.</NOTE>  brevissimus a Judland <NOTE N="3605" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> est  <HI REND="ITALIC">addit</HI>  4. br. est t. a 1. 9.</NOTE> 
transitus ex omni parte. Civitas ibi magna Odansue <NOTE N="3606" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> Odanswe 2.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ubi supra scriptum:</HI>  Othonia. Odanse 4. Odense 5. magna
est Odanse 7.</NOTE> ,
insulae in giro parvulae, omnes frugibus
plenae. Et notandum est, si per Judland in <NOTE N="****" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  106. Primus in Finnia episcopus Rehinherus erat, secundus Eilbertus monachus. (8 <SUP>b</SUP> . 9)</NOTE>  Funem
tenderis <NOTE N="3607" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> tetenderis 2. 9. 10. tendis 7.</NOTE> , directam <NOTE N="3608" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> directe 2. 4. 6. 9. 10, directo 5.</NOTE>  in septentrionem viam
habes <NOTE N="(835)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0624" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0624D"></COL> Hinc palam fit, quod jam ex cap. 2 colligendum
est, Adamum nostrum situm insulae Funis
nimis versus septentrionem collocasse.</NOTE> . At vero per Funem transeunti ad Seland,
oriens in faciem currit <NOTE N="3609" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> occurrit 2. 4. 9. 10.</NOTE> . Duo trajectus sunt
 <COL N="0624B"></COL> in Seland, unus a Fune, alter ab Arhusan, pari uterque
 <NOTE N="3610" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> utrique 10.</NOTE>  distant <NOTE N="3611" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> distat 4.</NOTE>  spatio. Mare natura tempestuosum
duplicique <NOTE N="3612" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> que  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  9.</NOTE>  plenum periculo, ut etiamsi ventum
habeas prosperum <NOTE N="3613" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> procerum 1.</NOTE> , vix effugias manus pyratarum.</P> <P COM="0624">5.  <CITN>(Cap. 212.)</CITN>  Seland <NOTE N="*****" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  107. Inter Seland et Funem insula est parvula, quam Sprogam dicunt: ea est spelunca latronum,
magnus timor omnium transeuntium <NOTE N="3619" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Sic corrixi.</HI>  Item a 7.  <HI REND="ITALIC">In cod. 6. vox abscissa.</HI></NOTE> . (6. 7.)</NOTE>  insula est in interiori sinu
maris Baltici sita, quantitate maxima <NOTE N="******" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  108. Primus in Selandia episcopus Gerbrandus erat, secundus Avocco, tertius Willelmus.
(8 <SUP>b</SUP> . 9.)</NOTE> . Haec tam
fortitudine virorum quam opulentia frugum celeberrima,
longitudinem habet bidui, cum latitudo fere <NOTE N="3614" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> vere 9.</NOTE> 
sit aequalis. Civitas ejus maxima Roschald <NOTE N="3615" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> Roscald 1. Roskeld 2.
9. Roschild 4. 7. Rochylt 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> , sedes
regia Danorum. Haec insula aequali spatio distans a
 <COL N="0624C"></COL> Fune vel Sconia, per noctem transitur <NOTE N="3616" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0623" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0623"></COL> pertransitur 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> , habetque
 <COL N="0625A"></COL> ab occidente Judland, civitatem Arhusan, vel <NOTE N="3619*" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> vel  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2. 4. 9.</NOTE> 
Alaburg <NOTE N="3620" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Alaborgh 2. Alaburch 7 <SUP>c</SUP> . Alaburgh 9.</NOTE>  et Wendilam <NOTE N="3621" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> insulam  <HI REND="ITALIC">addunt</HI>  8. 9.</NOTE> , a borea vero <NOTE N="3622" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> vero
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE> , ubi et
deserta est, fretum Nordmanniae <NOTE N="3623" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Norduegiae 8. Nordwegiae 2. Norvegiae 9.</NOTE> , a meridie autem
Funem praedictam et sinum Sclavanicum, ab ortu <NOTE N="3624" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> ortu quidem 4.</NOTE> 
respicit promunctorium <NOTE N="3625" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> promontorium 5.</NOTE>  Sconiae, ubi est civitas
Lundona <NOTE N="3626" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Londona
2. 8. 9.</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0625">6.  <CITN>(Cap. 213.)</CITN>  Aurum ibi plurimum, quod raptu
congeritur pyratico. Ipsi enim <NOTE N="3627" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> vero 1.</NOTE>  pyratae, quos illi
Wichingos <NOTE N="3628" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Winchigos 1. Winchindos 9. Withingos 5. Vichingos 10. Wichinger 8.
Niningingos 7.</NOTE>  appellant, nostri Ascomannos <NOTE N="3629" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Aschomannos 6.</NOTE> ,
regi Danico tributum solvunt, ut liceat eis praedam
exercere a barbaris, qui circa hoc mare plurimi <NOTE N="3630" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> plurimum 7.</NOTE> 
habundant. Unde etiam contingit <NOTE N="3631" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> contigit 1. 5. 10.</NOTE> , ut licentia <NOTE N="3632" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> liceat 1.</NOTE> ,
quam in hostes acceperunt, saepe abutantur <NOTE N="3633" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> abutuntur
7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  in
suos, adeo fide nulla utrique ad invicem sunt, et sine
misericordia quisque <NOTE N="3634" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> quisquis 7 <SUP>c</SUP></NOTE>  alterum, mox ut ceperit,
 <COL N="0625B"></COL> in jus famulicii vel <NOTE N="3635" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> vel  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  7.</NOTE>  socio vendit vel barbaro. Et
multa quidem alia tam in legibus quam moribus
aequo bonoque contraria Dani habent; ex quibus
ni <NOTE N="3636" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> nichil 4. nihil 9. 10.</NOTE>  utile mihi visum est ut dicerem <NOTE N="3637" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> dicem 2.</NOTE> , nisi quod
mulieres, si constupratae <NOTE N="3638" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> construpratae 6. stupratae
10.</NOTE>  fuerint <NOTE N="3639" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> fuerunt 9.</NOTE> , statim venduntur.
Viri autem, si vel regiae majestatis rei vel <NOTE N="3640" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> vel  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4. 9. 10.</NOTE> 
in aliquo fuerint scelere deprehensi, decollari malunt
quam verberari <NOTE N="*" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  109. Publica securis in foro pendet minitans reis capitalem sententiam, qua, si ita <NOTE N="3670" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Quasi ita 7 <SUP>a</SUP> <SUP>c</SUP> .
quod ita 7 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  contigerit
 <NOTE N="3671" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> contigit 7 <SUP>b</SUP> . 10.</NOTE> , accepta, videas <NOTE N="3672" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> videns 7.</NOTE>  moriturum exultantem ire ad supplicium quasi ad convivium.
(6. 7.)</NOTE> . Alia non est ibi species
poenae <NOTE N="3641" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> mortis  <HI REND="ITALIC">addit</HI>  9.</NOTE>  praeter securem vel <NOTE N="3642" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> et 4.</NOTE>  servitutem, et
tunc <NOTE N="3643" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> tunc  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  cum dampnatus fuerit, laetum esse gloria
est. Nam lacrimas et planctum ceteraque genera
compunctionis, quae nos salubria censemus, ita abhominantur
Dani, ut nec pro peccatis suis ulli flere
liceat nec pro caris defunctis.</P> <P COM="0625">7.  <CITN>(Cap. 214.)</CITN>  A Seland in Sconiam trajectus
 <COL N="0625C"></COL> multi, brevissimus in Halsinpurgh <NOTE N="3644" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Halsinpurg 1. Helsenburgh 9. Halsingburg 2. 7. Halsingeburg 4. Halsingburgh 8.</NOTE> , qui et vider
 <COL N="0626A"></COL> potest. <NOTE N="**" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  110. Primus in Scania episcopus Bernardus erat <NOTE N="3673" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Pr. episc. Scaniensis Wernarius 9.</NOTE> , secundus Henricus, et Egino <NOTE N="3674" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Eguio 9.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">saepius.</HI></NOTE> . (8 <SUP>b</SUP>  9.)</NOTE>  Sconia <NOTE N="3645" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> itaque  <HI REND="ITALIC">addit</HI>  4.</NOTE>  est pulcherrima visu Daniae
provintia, unde et dicitur, armata viris, opulenta
frugibus divesque in <NOTE N="3646" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> in  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2. 4. 7. 9. 10.</NOTE>  mercibus, et nunc plena
ecclesiis. Sconia bis tantum habet in spacio quam <NOTE N="3647" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> ut 4.</NOTE> 
Selandia, hoc est <NOTE N="3648" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Seland. Habet 7 <SUP>a</SUP> <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  trecentas ecclesias, cum Seland
dicatur habere dimidium, Funis terciam partem.
Sconia est pars ultima Daniae, fere insula;
undique enim <NOTE N="3649" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> enim  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4.</NOTE>  cincta est <NOTE N="3650" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> est  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4.</NOTE>  mari, praeter unum
terrae brachium, quod <NOTE N="3651" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> qui
1.</NOTE>  ab oriente continens
Sueoniam <NOTE N="3652" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Suediam 4. Sconiam 7.</NOTE>  disterminat <NOTE N="3653" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> continet S. disterminans 6.</NOTE>  a Dania. Ubi sunt profundi
 <NOTE N="3654" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> profundissimi 6.</NOTE>  saltus montesque asperrimi, per quos a
Sconia in <NOTE N="3655" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> in  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  Gothiam necessario iter agitur, ut
dubites, utrum levius sit marino <NOTE N="3656" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> magno 9.</NOTE>  discrimine terrestre
periculum vitare, an istud illi praeponere. <NOTE N="***" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  111. Ab hac insula primum egressi sunt Longobarbi vel Gothi, et vocatur ab historicis
Romanorum Scantia vel Gangavia <NOTE N="(838)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625D"></COL> Gangaviam de Germanicis insulis maximam
 <COL N="0626D"></COL> esse meminit Solinus c. 20.</NOTE>  sive Scandinavia <NOTE N="3675" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Scandanavia 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(839)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0626" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0626D"></COL> Langobardos ab insula Scandinavia adventasse,
Paulus Warnefrid. De gestis Langobard. l. I,
c. 2; Gothos de Scanziae insulae gremio egressos
refert Jordanis De reb. Gethicis.</NOTE> . Cujus metropolis
civitas Lundona, quam victor Angliae Chnud <NOTE N="3676" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Chund 7 <SUP>b</SUP> <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  Britannicae Lundonae aemulam jussit
esse <NOTE N="3677" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> prece. 6.</NOTE> . (6. 7.)</NOTE></P> <P COM="0626">8. <NOTE N="3657" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Hoc caput ita ut sequens desunt</HI>  7.</NOTE>   <CITN>(Cap. 215)</CITN>  In eadem regione Sconia <NOTE N="3658" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Sconiae 5. Scaniae 2. 8.</NOTE> 
 <COL N="0626B"></COL> nemo adhuc episcopus fuit incardinatus <NOTE N="3659" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> inordinatus  <HI REND="ITALIC">F.</HI></NOTE>  nisi quod
ab aliis partibus quidam venientes, interdum illam <NOTE N="3660" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> aliam 9.</NOTE> 
procurabant diocesim <NOTE N="(836)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625D"></COL> Veluti Bernardus. Vide supra l. II, cap. 53.</NOTE> . Deinde Selandensis <NOTE N="3661" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Seladensis 4.</NOTE> 
episcopus Gerbrand, et post eum Avoco, simul gubernabant
utrasque ecclesias <NOTE N="3662" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> utramque g. ecclesiam 4.</NOTE> . Nuper vero mortuo
Avocone, rex Suein parrochiam Sconiensem <NOTE N="3663" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> Scaniensem 8 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> 
in duos episcopatus <NOTE N="****" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  112. Su <HI REND="ITALIC">ecis predicabant</HI>  Lif <HI REND="ITALIC">dag, Pop</HI> po,  <HI REND="ITALIC">senior</HI>  Odink <HI REND="ITALIC">ar,</HI>  Gotebald, q. . . . . n. . . . et. . .
te. . . . (6.)</NOTE>  segregavit <NOTE N="(837)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0625" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0625D"></COL> Circa annum 1060, ut ex numero annorum
