et qui in Hulmo <NOTE N="3682" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0627" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0627"></COL> Hulmi 4. Ulmo 6. 9. 10.  <HI REND="ITALIC">In cod. 8. voci</HI>  Hulmo  <HI REND="ITALIC">adscriptum est:</HI>  Burgundeholm,
Burgingeholm 9.</NOTE>  insula <NOTE N="(841)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0627" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0627D"></COL> Bornholm.</NOTE>  degunt affines Gothis <NOTE N="3683" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0627" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0627"></COL> affines Gothis  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  4.</NOTE> .
Qui omnes dicuntur <NOTE N="3684" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0627" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0627"></COL> dicuntur  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4.</NOTE>  ad ejus praedicationem
conversi ad <NOTE N="3685" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0627" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0627"></COL> in 4.</NOTE>  lacrimas, poenitentiam sui
