in Christum crediderant <NOTE N="3696" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0627" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0627"></COL> crediderunt 10.</NOTE> , et <NOTE N="3697" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0627" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0627"></COL> et  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. 5.</NOTE>  incredulis verbum
Dei constanter annuncians. Ibi etiam opinatissimum
Fricconis <NOTE N="3698" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0627" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0627"></COL> Friconis 9.</NOTE>  simulacrum in frusta concidit.
Pro quibus virtutum insignibus <NOTE N="(842)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0627" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0627D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Virtutum insignia,</HI>  id est exempla, documenta
