orientis commercio cum Russia et Scandinavia
medio aevo pag. 27.</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0629">11.  <CITN>(Cap. 218.)</CITN>  Quod autem dicit <NOTE N="3731" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0629" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0629"></COL> dicitur idem sinus 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  eundem
 <HI REND="ITALIC">sinum longitudinis incompertae</HI> <NOTE N="(849)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0629" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0629D"></COL> Sc. mare Balticum. Conf. Einhard l. I.</NOTE> , hoc <NOTE N="3732" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0629" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0629"></COL> apparuit hoc quondam 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  nuper
apparuit in sollertia fortissimorum virorum Ganuz
 <NOTE N="3733" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0629" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0629"></COL> Gamir 7 <SUP>a</SUP> . Ganur 7 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <SUP>c</SUP> . Ganund 2. 4. 10. Gamund 9.</NOTE>  Wolf, satrapae Danorum, sive Haroldi <NOTE N="3734" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0629" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0629"></COL> Haraldi 9.</NOTE> ,
regis Nordmannorum, qui magno viae labore multoque
sociorum periculo, quantitatem <NOTE N="(850)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0629" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0629D"></COL> Quantitas pro magnitudine s. latitudine, ut
et supra cap. 5.</NOTE>  hujus
maris perscrutantes, ancipiti demum jactura ventorum
ac pyratarum fracti victique redierunt. Affirmant
autem Dani, longitudinem hujus ponti saepe a
pluribus <NOTE N="3735" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0629" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0629"></COL> a pluribus  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  7.</NOTE>  expertam <NOTE N="3736" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0629" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0629"></COL> ac  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  9. 10.</NOTE> , secundo flatu per mensem
 <COL N="0629B"></COL> aliquos a Dania pervenisse in Ostrogard <NOTE N="*" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0629" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0629"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  116. Ruzzia vocatur <NOTE N="3779" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0629" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0629"></COL> vero 7 <SUP>a</SUP> . Rusia 7.  <HI REND="ITALIC">semper.</HI></NOTE>  a barbaris Danis Ostrogard, eo quod in oriente posita quasi hortus irriguus
