hoc est aurum, argentum, sonipedes regios, pelles
castorum <NOTE N="3959" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> castrorum 7 <SUP>c</SUP>   <HI REND="ITALIC">F.</HI></NOTE>  vel <NOTE N="3960" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> et 4.</NOTE>  marturum <NOTE N="3961" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> martarum 2. 9. 10.</NOTE> , quae nos ammiratione
 <NOTE N="3962" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> admiratione 2. 4.</NOTE>  sui dementes <NOTE N="3963" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> clementes 2.</NOTE>  faciunt, illi pro nichilo
 <COL N="0638A"></COL> ducunt. In sola mulierum copula <NOTE N="3964" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> copia 7.</NOTE>  modum nesciunt.
Quisque secundum facultatem suarum virium
duas aut tres et <NOTE N="3965" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> vel 4. vel tres vel 7.</NOTE>  amplius simul habet; divites et
 <NOTE N="3966" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> ac 9.</NOTE>  principes absque numero <NOTE N="(896)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0638" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0638B"></COL> De polygamia Nortmannorum v. Dudon.
 <COL N="0638C"></COL> De moribus et actibus Normann. l. I init.</NOTE> . Nam et filios ex
tali conjunctione genitos habent legitimos. Capitali
vero pena multatur, si quis uxorem alterius cognoverit,
aut vi oppresserit <NOTE N="3967" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> violaverit 1.</NOTE>  virginem <NOTE N="3968" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> aut—virginem  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  6.</NOTE> , sive qui
alterum spoliaverit bonis suis, aut injuriam fecerit
 <NOTE N="3969" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> aut
vi interfecerit 9.</NOTE> . Hospitalitate quamvis omnes Yperborei sint <NOTE N="3970" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> sunt 9.</NOTE> 
insignes, praecipui sunt nostri <NOTE N="3971" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  Sueones; quibus
est omni probro gravius hospicium negare transeuntibus,
ita ut studium vel <NOTE N="3972" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> studium vel  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  4. et certamen 9.</NOTE>  certamen habeant inter
illos <NOTE N="3973" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> se 4.
7.</NOTE> , quis dignus sit recipere hospitem. Cui
exhibens <NOTE N="3974" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> Cui cum exhibuerint 7.</NOTE>  omnia jura humanitatis, quot diebus
illic <NOTE N="3975" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> ibi 9.</NOTE>  commorari voluerit, ad amicos eum suos
 <COL N="0638B"></COL> <NOTE N="3976" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> suos illum 2. 4.</NOTE>  certatim per singulas dirigit <NOTE N="3977" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> dirigunt 7.</NOTE>  mansiones. Haec
illi bona in moribus habent. Praedicatores autem
veritatis, si casti prudentesque ac ydonei sunt <NOTE N="3978" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> prudentes et
ydonei sint 4.</NOTE> ,
ingenti amore fovent, aden ut concilio populorum
communi <NOTE N="3979" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> consilio communi 9. 10.</NOTE> , quod ab ipsis warh <NOTE N="3980" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> warch 2. 7. 8. varch 10. warth 9. warph 4. 5. 6.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Cod. 4. in margine post vocabulum</HI>  ipsis  <HI REND="ITALIC">recentiori manu addit:</HI>  quod ab ipsis thinc a nobis;  <HI REND="ITALIC">inde</HI>  5: quod
ab ipsis warph a nobis thinc.</NOTE>  vocatur, episcopos
interesse <NOTE N="3981" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> inter se esse 7.</NOTE>  non renuant <NOTE N="3982" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Hic deficit codex</HI>  4.</NOTE> . Ubi de Christo
et <NOTE N="3983" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> ac 5.</NOTE>  christiana religione crebro <NOTE N="3984" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> crebro
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  9.</NOTE>  audiunt non
inviti. Et fortasse facili <NOTE N="3985" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> profecto facile 5. 9. 10. facili  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  sermone ad nostram
fidem illi <NOTE N="3986" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0637" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0637"></COL> ad summam nostrae fidei 7. illi  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2. 9. 10.</NOTE>  persuaderentur, nisi quod mali docteres,
dum sua quaerunt, non quae Jesu Christi  <CITN>(Phil.
II, 21)</CITN> , scandalizant eos qui possent salvari.</P> <P COM="0638">22.  <CITN>(Cap. 231)</CITN> . Populi Sueonum multi sunt, viribus
et armis egregii, praeterea tam in equis quam in
navibus juxta optimi bellatores. Unde etiam sua
 <COL N="0639A"></COL> potentia ceteras aquilonis gentes constringere <NOTE N="3995" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> confringere 5. 8 <SUP>b</SUP> . 9.</NOTE> 
videntur. Reges habent ex genere antiquo <NOTE N="3996" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> antiquos 1. 5. 6. 7 <SUP>4</SUP> .</NOTE> , quorum
tamen vis <NOTE N="3997" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> jus 2. 8. 9. 10.</NOTE>  pendet in populi sentencia; quod in
commune <NOTE N="3998" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> communi 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  omnes laudaverint, illum <NOTE N="(902)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Illum,</HI>  sc. regem.</NOTE>  confirmare
oportet, nisi ejus decretum pocius videatur,
quod aliquando <NOTE N="3999" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> aliqui
7 <SUP>c</SUP> . 9.</NOTE>  secuntur inviti <NOTE N="4000" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> multi 1.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="*" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  128. Omnia quae aguntur <NOTE N="4036" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> agantur 8 <SUP>b</SUP> . geruntur 9.</NOTE>  inter barbaros, sortiendo fiunt <NOTE N="4037" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> sciunt 2. 9. faciunt 8 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  in privatis rebus. In publicis
autem causis et <NOTE N="4038" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> etiam 5. 8 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  demonum responsa peti solent, sicut in gestis sancti Ansgarii <NOTE N="(905)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0640" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0640D"></COL> Ib. c. 18, 19, 27, 30.</NOTE> 
potest cognosci. (2. 5. 6. 8 <SUP>e</SUP> . 9.</NOTE> . Itaque
domi pares esse gaudent. In praelium euntes omnem
praebent obedientiam regi <NOTE N="4001" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> r. sno 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> , vel ei qui doctior <NOTE N="4002" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> doctior  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  9. doctor 8.</NOTE> 
ceteris a rege praefertur. Si quando vero <NOTE N="4003" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Si vero aliquando 7. Si qui vero 9.</NOTE>  praeliantes
in angustia positi sunt <NOTE N="4004" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> sint  <HI REND="ITALIC">M. F.</HI></NOTE> , ex multitudine
deorum quos colunt <NOTE N="4005" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> quos colunt  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  9. 10.</NOTE> , unum invocant auxilio
 <NOTE N="4006" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> unum in auxilium invocant 2. 3. 9.</NOTE> : ei <NOTE N="4007" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> cui 6.</NOTE>  post victoriam deinceps sunt devoti,
illumque ceteris anteponunt. Deum <NOTE N="4008" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> dominum
40.</NOTE>  autem christianorum
jam communi sentencia fortiorem <NOTE N="4009" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> ferociorem 9.</NOTE> 
clamant omnibus esse; alios deos sepe fallere, illum
 <COL N="0639B"></COL> porro semper astare certissimum adjutorem in
oportunitatibus <NOTE N="4010" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> in omnibus o. 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0639">23.  <CITN>(Cap 232)</CITN> . Ex ipsis populis Suediae <NOTE N="4011" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Sueoniae 2. 10. Sueonum 9.</NOTE>  proximi
ad nos habitant Gothi <NOTE N="**" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  129. Gothi a Romanis vocantur Getae, de quibus Virgilius dicere videtur <NOTE N="4039" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> dicit 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> :

 <POEM COM="0639"><L>. . . . acerque Gelonus <NOTE N="4040" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Gelanus 2.
8 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE></L> <L>Cum fugit in Rhodopen <NOTE N="4041" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Rodopen 2. 8 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> , atque in deserta Getarum,</L> <L>Et lac concretum cum sanguine potat equino <NOTE N="(906)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0640" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0640D"></COL> Georg. l. III, v. 461 sq.</NOTE> .</L></POEM> 

Hoc usque hodie Gothi et Sembi <NOTE N="4042" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Serabi  <HI REND="ITALIC">F.</HI></NOTE>  facere dicuntur, quos ex lacte jumentorum inebriari
certum est <NOTE N="(907)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0640" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0640D"></COL> V. supra c. 18 fin.</NOTE> . (2. 5. 6. 7. 8 <SUP>b</SUP> .)</NOTE> , qui occidentales dicuntur,
alii sunt orientales. Verum Westragothia <NOTE N="4012" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Westergothia
5. Vestragothia 9. 10.</NOTE> 
confinis est provinciae Danorum, quae Sconia dicitur.
A qua etiam <NOTE N="4013" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> etiam  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  fertur <NOTE N="4014" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> ferunt 2. 3. 7. 9.</NOTE>  diebus septem perveniri
usque ad civitatem Gothorum magnam Scarane
 <NOTE N="(903)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639D"></COL> Skara in Dalsland s. Skaraborg.</NOTE> . Deinde Ostrogothia <NOTE N="4015" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Astrogothia 7 <SUP>a</SUP> . Ostrogotia
5. Ostrogotica 9.</NOTE>  protenditur juxta
mare illud quod Balticum vocant <NOTE N="4016" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> vocatur 7. mare quod b. dicitur 5.</NOTE> , usque ad
 <COL N="0640A"></COL> Bircam. Primus Gothorum episcopus <NOTE N="***" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  130. Quamvis ante hos <NOTE N="4043" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> hoc  <HI REND="ITALIC">F.</HI></NOTE>  Danorum episcopi vel Anglorum <NOTE N="4044" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> in  <HI REND="ITALIC">addit</HI>  5. apud 8 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  Suediam praedicarunt <NOTE N="4045" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> praedicarint 5.</NOTE> .
Thurgot vero specialiter <NOTE N="4046" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> specialiter  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  8 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  in Gothiam ordinatus est ad sedem Scaranensem <NOTE N="4047" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Scarinensem. 2.</NOTE> . (2.
5. 6. 8 <SUP>e</SUP> .)</NOTE> , Thurgot
 <NOTE N="4017" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Thurgoth 6. Thurgotus 10. Thurgotius 9.</NOTE>  fuit, secundus vero <NOTE N="4018" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> vero  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4. 9.</NOTE>  Godescalcus, vir sapiens
et bonus, ut praedicant <NOTE N="4019" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> ut praedicant  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  5.</NOTE> , nisi quod domi sedens
ocium labori praetulit <NOTE N="4020" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> praetulerit 9.</NOTE> . Tercium <NOTE N="4021" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> tertium autem 5.</NOTE>  ordinavit
noster metropolitanus Adalwardum <NOTE N="****" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> <P COM="0639"><HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  131. A rege Haroldo invitatus Adalwardus quoque in Nordwegiam venit et pro sanctitate
viri <NOTE N="4048" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> viri  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  fama virtutum ejus honorifice susceptus est. Cui abeunti rex tantum pecuniae
obtulit, ut exinde statim 300 captivos redemit episcopus <NOTE N="4049" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> redimeret 5. 9. redemerit 8 <SUP>h</SUP> .</NOTE> .</P> 

 <P COM="0639">Adalwardus <NOTE N="4050" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> autem  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  5. 9.</NOTE>  junior eo tempore veniens in Gothiam, cognominem suum <NOTE N="4051" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> suum  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  reperit
infirmum; cujus exequias cum luctu procurans, in Sictonam <NOTE N="4052" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> procurans Sictoniam 5. 9.</NOTE>  properavit. Sed postea
cum repulsus esset a paganis, invitatus venit ad Scaranem <NOTE N="4053" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Scaranen 5.</NOTE>  civitatem, quod nostro
archiepiscopo non bene placuit <NOTE N="4054" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> displicuit
6. valde displicuit 5. 9.</NOTE> , quare eum sicut violatorem canonum vocavit Bremam.
(2. 5. 6. 8 <SUP>b</SUP> .)</P></NOTE>  seniorem,
vere <NOTE N="4022" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> vere  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI> 
10.</NOTE>  laudabilem virum <NOTE N="(904)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639D"></COL> V. supra l. III, c. 14.</NOTE> . Qui deinde perveniens
ad barbaros, ut <NOTE N="4023" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> sicut 2. 5. 9. 10.</NOTE>  docuit, ita <NOTE N="4024" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> ita  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  9.</NOTE>  vixit. Nam
sancte vivendo <NOTE N="4025" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> ac  <HI REND="ITALIC">addunt</HI>  2. 5. 10. et 9.</NOTE> , bene docendo magnam gentilium
multitudinem traxisse fertur ad christianam fidem
 <NOTE N="4026" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> ad ch. convertit fidem 5.</NOTE> . Claruit etiam virtutum <NOTE N="4027" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Qui e. v. claruit 5.</NOTE>  miraculis, ita ut
poscentibus in necessitate barbaris, ymbrem <NOTE N="4028" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> imbrem de coelo 5.</NOTE> 
faceret descendere vel denuo serenitatem venire, et
alia quae hactenus quaeruntur a doctoribus. Is autem
vir memorabilis in Gothia permansit <NOTE N="4029" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> permanens 5.</NOTE> , nomen
domini Jesu constanter omnibus praedicans <NOTE N="4030" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> praedicavit 5.</NOTE> ,
 <COL N="0640B"></COL> ibidemque post multos agones, quos pro Christo
libenter sustinuit, victricem terrae carnem tradidit,
spiritus coelum petiit laureatus. Post quem archiepiscopus
ordinavit in illas partes quendam Acilinum,
nichil ferentem episcopali nomine dignum <NOTE N="4031" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> dignum  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE> ,
praeter ingentem corporis staturam. Et ille quidem
diligens carnis requiem, frustra <NOTE N="4032" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> frustratam 2. 8. 9.</NOTE>  mittentibus legationem
Gothis, usque ad obitum suae Coloniae mansit
 <NOTE N="4033" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> permansit 2. 5. 9</NOTE>  in deliciis <NOTE N="4034" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Primus Gothorum—deliciis  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  7.</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0640">24. Inter <NOTE N="4035" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0639" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0639"></COL> Item 1.</NOTE>  Nordmanniam et Sueoniam Wermilani
 <COL N="0641A"></COL> <NOTE N="4055" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0641" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0641"></COL> Wermelani 2. S. 9. Warmelanos 5. Wermulani 7. Vermelani 10.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(908)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0641" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0641C"></COL> Wärmeland in provincia Suecica Carlstad.</NOTE>  et Finnedi <NOTE N="4056" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0641" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0641"></COL> Finwedi 5. 9. Findwedi 2.
Finvedi 10.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(909)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0641" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0641C"></COL> Finnheide, Finnwald, in occidentalibus partibus
provinciae Smalandiae versus Hallandiam. Conf.
Cl. E. G. Geijer Geschichte Schwedens t. I,
p. 52.</NOTE>  degunt, et alii:
qui nunc omnes sunt christiani, respitiuntque ad
Scaranensem ecclesiam. In confinio Sueonum vel
Nortmannorum contra boream habitant Scritefini
 <NOTE N="4057" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0641" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0641"></COL> Scitefini 6. Scritefinni 2. 8. 10. Scritesfinni 7. Scridofinni 9. Scritefingi  <HI REND="ITALIC">F.</HI></NOTE> , quos aiunt cursu feras praeterire <NOTE N="4058" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0641" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0641"></COL> praeire
5. anteire 6.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(910)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0641" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0641C"></COL> Martianus l. I, pag. 226 narrat. Troglodytas
 <HI REND="ITALIC">feras cursu praeterire.</HI></NOTE> . Civitas
