 <HI REND="ITALIC">Ultima—dies</HI>  ex Solini cap. 22 excerpsit.</NOTE> . Item Beda <NOTE N="4403" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> Beva 6.</NOTE>  scribit,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">in</HI> <NOTE N="**" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  147. Brittania est omnium maxima insularum. A qua novem dierum navigatione pervenitur ad
