a glacie quae <NOTE N="****" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  149. Juxta Island est oceanus glaciatus et fervens et caligans <NOTE N="4435" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> caliginosus 5. 8 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> . (5. 6. 7. 7 <SUP>c</SUP> . 8 <SUP>b</SUP> .)</NOTE>  occeanum astringit <NOTE N="4412" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> adstringit 9.</NOTE> . De
qua etiam hoc memorabile ferunt <NOTE N="4413" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> fertur 2 <SUP>a</SUP> . 9. 10.</NOTE> , quod eadem
glacies ita nigra et arida videatur propter antiquitatem,
ut incensa ardeat <NOTE N="(962)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0654" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0654B"></COL> Cf. Archiv. T. VI, pag. 888.</NOTE> . Est autem insula
permaxima <NOTE N="4414" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> permixta 7.</NOTE> , ita ut populos infra <NOTE N="4415" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> intra 5. 10. in 7 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  se multos
contineat, qui solo pecorum fetu vivunt eorumque
vellere teguntur: nullae ibi fruges, minima lignorum
