Christianitatem <NOTE N="*****" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  150. Apud illos non est rex, nisi <NOTE N="4436" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> sed 2 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  tantum lex:  <HI REND="ITALIC">et peccare nefas, aut pretium mori</HI> <NOTE N="4437" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> est mori
2 <SUP>a</SUP> . 7. 8.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(965)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0654" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0654B"></COL> Horat. Carm. III, 24, v. 24.</NOTE> .
(2 <SUP>a</SUP> . 5. 6. 7. 9. 10.)</NOTE> . Multa insignia in moribus <NOTE N="4422" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> montibus 9.</NOTE> 
eorum, precipua <NOTE N="4423" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> praecipue 5. 9.</NOTE>  karitas, ex qua procedit, ut
inter illos <NOTE N="4424" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> illos  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. 7. 9. eos 5.</NOTE>  omnia communia sint tam advenis
quam indigenis <NOTE N="4425" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> tam
