pro rege; ad illius <NOTE N="4427" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> cujus 5.</NOTE>  nutum respicit omnis populus,
 <COL N="0654B"></COL> quicquid ex Deo, ex scripturis, ex consuetudine
aliarum gentium ille constituit, hoc pro lege
habent <NOTE N="******" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Schol.</HI>  151. Civitas ibi <NOTE N="4438" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> eorum 7 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  maxima Scaldholz <NOTE N="4439" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0653" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0653"></COL> ML Scaldholz 7.</NOTE> . (6. 7.)</NOTE> . [De quibus noster metropolitanus inmensas
