menses 10, dies 7 <NOTE N="33" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0665" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0665"></COL> annis XXII. 3.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(35)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0665" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0665C"></COL> Obiit Liavinzo anno 1013, Febr. 4.</NOTE> . [Hic primus a suffraganeis
