millesimo <NOTE N="35" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0665" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0665"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">rectius</HI>  MII.</NOTE>  incarnationis Domini anno, tercius
 <COL N="0666A"></COL> Otto obiit; 22 <SUP>m</SUP> <SUP>o</SUP>  Bernhardus dux, et Liudgerus, frater
ejus <NOTE N="(37)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0665" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0665C"></COL> Conf. eumdem l. II, c. 40 et 44.</NOTE></P> <P COM="0666">Unvanus [pallium suscepit a papa Benedicto,
