ei quem supra strinximus, cum Jan. 4 a Jan. 28
subtraxerit.</NOTE> . Iste Olaph regem Nortmannorum et
Chutun <NOTE N="36" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0665" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0665"></COL> Kanutum
3.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Leg.</HI>  Chnut.</NOTE>  Danorum familiares reddidit Christo. Hujus
14 anno <NOTE N="37" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0665" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0665"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">rectius</HI>  XII. Anno ejus VII. II. i. obiit 3.</NOTE>  Heinricus imperator obiit.</P> <P COM="0666">Liavinzo <NOTE N="38" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0665" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0665"></COL> Yawizo 2.</NOTE>  junior <NOTE N="39" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0665" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0665"></COL> junior  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  3,</NOTE>  [pallium suscepit a papa
