dies 24 <NOTE N="42" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0665" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0665"></COL> Hermianus sedit annum I. dies XIV. 2.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(43)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0666" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0666C"></COL> Obiit a. 1035, Sept. 19.</NOTE></P> <P COM="0666">Alebrandus [pallium suscepit a papa Benedicto,
