5 <NOTE N="(57)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0667" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0667A"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Poppo</HI>  1010-1015. Conf. ibid. c. 33, 44.</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0668">Esico episcopus II Idus Februarii. Sedit annos
